{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415326","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415326","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041532601:1":{"text":"에디, 내 이름이지! 만나서 반갑다고!","source_cn":"阿德，我的名字——很高兴认识你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7E4B31E18E6C680","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041532602:1":{"text":"나는 너를 모른다.","source_cn":"我不认识你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFB3E94FB81C42AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041532603:1":{"text":"이젠 아는 사이잖아?","source_cn":"现在不就认识了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF781BDE82FB80151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041532604:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041532605:1":{"text":"에이, 루카 형씨! 뭘 그렇게 험상궂게 쳐다보고 그래? 친하게 지내자고 하는 거잖아. 우리의... 음, 앞으로의 굳건한 우정을 위해서!","source_cn":"卢卡兄弟，眼神别那么凶嘛！我在向你抛出友好的橄榄枝，为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26B06B3CF2D563D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041532606:1":{"text":"너는 쓸모가 있나?","source_cn":"你很有用？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA46E7C530B4BF11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041532607:1":{"text":"아이고오, 그게 중요하다 이거지? 맞아, 친구가 되려면 쓸모를 증명해야 하는 법이지.","source_cn":"哎呀呀，您一针见血！的确，要打交道，证明自己有用最重要。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1302929CC4E6C2C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041532608:1":{"text":"자랑하는 건 아닌데, 작게는 자물쇠 정도는 만능 열쇠처럼 쉽게 딸 수 있고 크게는... 현상금 사냥꾼들이나 적대 세력의 정보 정도를 줄 수 있겠네.","source_cn":"不是我自夸，小到什么锁都能撬开的万用钥匙，大到——比如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5522F45C094A2094","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041532609:1":{"text":"흥, 신밧드 녀석과 똑같군.","source_cn":"哼，和辛巴达那小子一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BBBC17B82446E2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041532610:1":{"text":"오? 동종업계 종사자인가? 그럼 꼭 만나봐야 할 것 같은데? 그 신밧드라는 녀석의 자원이 내 자원이 될 수도 있으니까! 상호 이용... 아니, 상호 이익이라는 말도 있잖아!","source_cn":"哎呀呀，你认识我的同行？那可一定要让我见见，他的资源也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x470F049CD5C9594E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041532611:1":{"tex